00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:04,220
Some applications of map scale.

2
00:00:06,960 --> 00:00:08,650
Problem 1:

3
00:00:13,740 --> 00:00:23,690
Map of elementary school of commune A is drawn according to scale 1 : 300

4
00:00:26,820 --> 00:00:52,880
On map, school gate width is 2 cm (distance from A to B). Ask actual width of school gate is how many meters?

5
00:00:54,940 --> 00:00:57,340
Problem states what?

6
00:00:59,770 --> 00:01:09,700
Map of elementary school of commune A drawn according to scale 1 : 300

7
00:01:11,450 --> 00:01:18,600
School gate width is 2 cm

8
00:01:20,060 --> 00:01:24,020
Problem asks what?

9
00:01:28,360 --> 00:01:34,920
Ask actual width of school gate is how many meters?

10
00:01:38,170 --> 00:01:47,980
Perform conversion to meter unit then fill answer.

11
00:01:49,450 --> 00:01:54,940
Actual width of school gate is:

12
00:01:57,790 --> 00:02:07,470
2 x 300 = 600 cm = 6 m

13
00:02:09,770 --> 00:02:12,460
Answer: 6 m

14
00:02:17,700 --> 00:02:21,170
Problem 2:

15
00:02:22,830 --> 00:02:40,600
On map there is scale 1 : 1,000,000, Hanoi - Hai Phong distance measured 102 mm.

16
00:02:42,490 --> 00:02:49,230
Find actual length of Hanoi - Hai Phong distance.

17
00:02:50,960 --> 00:02:54,080
Problem states what?

18
00:02:55,820 --> 00:03:00,920
Scale 1 : 1,000,000

19
00:03:01,880 --> 00:03:10,140
Hanoi - Hai Phong distance measured 102 mm.

20
00:03:11,380 --> 00:03:14,410
Problem requires what?

21
00:03:16,240 --> 00:03:22,620
Find actual length of Hanoi - Hai Phong distance.

22
00:03:24,510 --> 00:03:28,480
Tell solution for problem.

23
00:03:30,920 --> 00:03:41,130
Fill calculation and calculate Hanoi - Hai Phong distance.

24
00:03:43,200 --> 00:03:53,840
Perform conversion to kilometer unit then fill answer.

25
00:04:00,240 --> 00:04:03,630
Solution

26
00:04:06,090 --> 00:04:11,940
Hanoi - Hai Phong distance length is:

27
00:04:15,130 --> 00:04:28,440
102 x 1,000,000 = 102,000,000 mm = 102 km

28
00:04:29,550 --> 00:04:34,290
Answer: 102 km

29
00:04:37,530 --> 00:04:39,290
Problem 3

30
00:04:44,410 --> 00:05:10,700
Distance between two points A and B on schoolyard is 20 m. Map has scale 1 : 500, distance between those two points is how many centimeters?

31
00:05:12,000 --> 00:05:15,640
Problem states what?

32
00:05:17,850 --> 00:05:25,240
Distance between two points A and B on schoolyard is 20 m.

33
00:05:26,280 --> 00:05:33,130
On map scale 1 : 500

34
00:05:34,300 --> 00:05:37,640
Problem asks what?

35
00:05:40,700 --> 00:05:47,450
Distance between two points on map is how many centimeters?

36
00:05:50,030 --> 00:05:54,520
To solve this problem we do as follows:

37
00:05:57,140 --> 00:06:07,930
First, convert distance A and B from meter unit to centimeter unit.

38
00:06:09,760 --> 00:06:23,090
Tell solution, fill calculation then calculate, then fill answer.

39
00:06:27,450 --> 00:06:29,320
Solution

40
00:06:32,090 --> 00:06:37,300
20 m = 2000 cm

41
00:06:40,190 --> 00:06:45,780
Distance between two points A and B on map is:

42
00:06:47,700 --> 00:06:54,050
2000 : 500 = 4 cm

43
00:06:56,560 --> 00:07:00,020
Answer: 4 cm

44
00:07:02,610 --> 00:07:06,840
Problem 4

45
00:07:08,860 --> 00:07:35,210
Hanoi - Son Tay distance is 41 km. On map scale 1 : 1,000,000, distance is how many millimeters?

46
00:07:36,180 --> 00:07:39,060
Problem states what?

47
00:07:41,540 --> 00:07:51,640
Hanoi - Son Tay distance is 41 km

48
00:07:53,210 --> 00:07:59,790
Map has scale 1 : 1,000,000

49
00:08:01,390 --> 00:08:04,910
Problem asks what?

50
00:08:07,080 --> 00:08:16,320
That distance on map is how many millimeters?

51
00:08:18,720 --> 00:08:22,250
To solve this problem we do as follows:

52
00:08:26,060 --> 00:08:34,770
Convert Hanoi - Son Tay distance from kilometer unit to millimeter unit.

53
00:08:36,100 --> 00:08:46,610
Tell solution, fill calculation, calculate then fill answer.

54
00:08:51,640 --> 00:08:53,400
Solution

55
00:08:56,280 --> 00:09:02,520
41 km = 41,000,000 mm

56
00:09:05,080 --> 00:09:10,890
Hanoi - Son Tay distance on map length is:

57
00:09:13,540 --> 00:09:22,530
41,000,000 : 1,000,000 = 41 mm

58
00:09:24,020 --> 00:09:28,090
Answer: 41 mm

